          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
               stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg></button></div>
      <div class="panneau-corps">
        <p class="vide" style="margin-bottom:12px">La répartition automatique équilibre
